---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
        title="Updates — CivicBrands"
        description="Recent CivicBrands publication, infrastructure, and directory updates."
>
    <section class="section">
        <p class="eyebrow">Updates</p>

        <div class="measure">
            <h1>What changed recently.</h1>
            <p>
                This page is a lightweight public change log. It is not a newsletter and not a feed
                optimized for attention. It is a record of material changes that help people understand
                what the site is becoming.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="update-list">
            <article>
                <p class="eyebrow">2026-06-06</p>
                <h2>Forecast linked into the CivicBrands set</h2>
                <p>
                    Forecast now appears as a live public surface from the homepage and Work metadata.
                    The site also added a systems overview so the KC directory, Forecast, Open Cognition,
                    research, artifacts, and procurement material read as one connected practice.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article>
                <p class="eyebrow">2026-06-06</p>
                <h2>KC discoverability and data reuse expanded</h2>
                <p>
                    The sitemap now includes the KC pages and Spanish KC pages. The KC data reuse page
                    documents exports, fields, reuse expectations, and correction paths.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article>
                <p class="eyebrow">2026-06-06</p>
                <h2>Procurement packet expanded</h2>
                <p>
                    Procurement now includes public entity facts, EIN, capability areas, public materials,
                    engagement posture, and explicit boundaries around harmful uses.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
